% BEGIN of inlined logic: the function of the decision service
% TaxFreezeIncomeService, below, copies the decision service
% TaxFreezeIncomeService of the imported model TaxFreezeIncome
% (tax-freeze-income.dmn); the business knowledge model spouse id of the
% imported model BDT (BDT.dmn).
% The copy keeps this program in one file. You may want to move the copied
% logic to a separate file of its own, and include that file in this program
% and in the other programs that use it ("the knowledge base ... includes
% these resources").
rule tax_freeze_income_service_1 with provenance the model at decision TaxFreezeIncomeService:
the tax freeze income service result is true if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 1 of the tax freeze income service result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and it is not the case that
        the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M <= 33500.

condition 1 of the tax freeze income service result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

rule tax_freeze_income_service_2 with provenance the model at decision TaxFreezeIncomeService:
the tax freeze income service result is true if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 2 of the tax freeze income service result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M <= 41500.

condition 2 of the tax freeze income service result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

rule tax_freeze_income_service_3 with provenance the model at decision TaxFreezeIncomeService:
the tax freeze income service result is false if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 3 of the tax freeze income service result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and it is not the case that
        the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M > 33500.

condition 3 of the tax freeze income service result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

rule tax_freeze_income_service_4 with provenance the model at decision TaxFreezeIncomeService:
the tax freeze income service result is false if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 4 of the tax freeze income service result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M > 41500.

condition 4 of the tax freeze income service result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

% END of inlined logic (service TaxFreezeIncomeService).
% BEGIN of inlined logic: the rules of the decision checks, below, copy the
% decision service PersonNotEnrolledInBenefitService of the imported model
% PersonNotEnrolledInBenefit (person-not-enrolled-in-benefit.dmn); the
% decision service PersonEnrolledInBenefitService of the imported model
% PersonEnrolledInBenefit (person-enrolled-in-benefit.dmn).
% The copy keeps this program in one file. You may want to move the copied
% logic to a separate file of its own, and include that file in this program
% and in the other programs that use it ("the knowledge base ... includes
% these resources").
rule checks_1 with provenance the model at decision checks:
the not already enrolled of the checks is true if
    the enrollments of the situation are listed
    and the primary person id of the situation is a text
    and it is not the case that
        the enrollments of the situation include a person id with a benefit
        and the primary person id of the situation is the text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the benefit is equal to "PhlLowIncomeTaxFreeze".

rule checks_2 with provenance the model at decision checks:
the not already enrolled of the checks is false if
    the enrollments of the situation are listed
    and the enrollments of the situation include a person id with a benefit
    and the person id is equal to the primary person id of the situation
    and the benefit is equal to "PhlLowIncomeTaxFreeze".

the owner occupant of the checks is the owner occupant service result, as stated in the model at decision checks.

the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is the lives in philadelphia pa service result, as stated in the model at decision checks.

the meets income requirement of the checks is the tax freeze income service result, as stated in the model at decision checks.

% END of inlined logic (decision checks).
rule is_eligible_1 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is true if
    the not already enrolled of the checks is true
    and the owner occupant of the checks is true
    and the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is true
    and the meets income requirement of the checks is true.

rule is_eligible_2 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the not already enrolled of the checks is false.

rule is_eligible_3 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the owner occupant of the checks is false.

rule is_eligible_4 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is false.

rule is_eligible_5 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the meets income requirement of the checks is false.

